OL,3,C'I want my son back': Mother's fight
OL,4,Cto free son jailed in 2005 over phone
OL,5,Ctheft
OL,7,FJust before our interview, Shirley
OL,8,FDebono's phone rings.
OL,10,FHer screen shows HMP Cardiff calling,
OL,11,Fthen an automated voice greets her
OL,12,Fbefore her son can talk - epitomising
OL,13,Fjust how far she is from him.
OL,15,F"Hiya mum you alright?"
OL,17,FShaun Lloyd, 39, was jailed in 2005
OL,18,Fand given an Indeterminate Sentence
OL,19,Ffor Public Protection (IPP) of two
OL,20,Fyears and nine months in 2006.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
