PN,31705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786234686
OL,3,C'I want my son back': Mother's fight
OL,4,Cto free son jailed in 2005 over phone
OL,5,Ctheft
OL,7,FShaun was one of the first prisoners
OL,8,Fto be given an IPP sentence -
OL,9,Fintroduced by Lord David Blunkett in
OL,10,F2005.
OL,12,FAbolished in 2012 - with Lord Blunkett
OL,13,Fdeeming it the single biggest stain on
OL,14,Fthe country's justice system - there
OL,15,Fare still more 2,329 PPs serving time,
OL,17,FAround 900 of them have never been
OL,18,Freleased.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
