OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786234686
OL,3,C'I want my son back': Mother's fight
OL,4,Cto free son jailed in 2005 over phone
OL,5,Ctheft
OL,7,FShirley, 65, has been campaigning for
OL,8,FIPPs to be released since 2008, three
OL,9,Fyears into her son's sentence.
OL,11,FIn 2022, I interviewed her as she
OL,12,Fprotested outside Downing Street and
OL,13,Fdelivered a letter through the door.
OL,15,FFour years and five prime ministers
OL,16,Flater, for her it seems painful to
OL,17,Ffeel hope.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786234686
OL,3,C'I want my son back': Mother's fight
OL,4,Cto free son jailed in 2005 over phone
OL,5,Ctheft
OL,7,F"We know a review could take years-and-
OL,8,Fyears. IPP prisoners haven't got
OL,9,Fyears, they haven't got months, some
OL,10,Fof them haven't got weeks," she said.
OL,12,F"I want my son back, I've fought for
OL,13,Flong enough."
OL,15,FA new report by the UN Working Group
OL,16,Fhas found Shaun is one of five IPP
OL,17,Fprisoners being held unlawfully,
OL,18,Fstating there is no "legal basis in
OL,19,Finternational law for their continued
OL,20,Fdetention".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786234686
OL,3,C'I want my son back': Mother's fight
OL,4,Cto free son jailed in 2005 over phone
OL,5,Ctheft
OL,7,FIt also said the prisoners are being
OL,8,Fsubjected to "psychological harm" and
OL,9,Fhas urged the government to "undertake
OL,10,Fa full independent investigation".
OL,12,FBarrister Dr Muin Bose, who has been
OL,13,Fleading the legal action, said:
OL,14,F"Whatever action is taken, it needs to
OL,15,Fbe taken quickly. I want my client to
OL,16,Fbe released, you know, as soon as
OL,17,Fpossible.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
